  /// When HERMESVM_COMPRESSED_POINTERS is ON, clamp \p maxHeapSize to
  /// [2 * kSegmentUnitSize, 4GB - kSegmentUnitSize], since we can't go beyond
  /// 4GB with compressed pointers. Otherwise, clamp it to
